785	     * Generate the deterministic household identifier for the given last name and postcode. The value
786	     * is derived from the normalized (case-insensitive, whitespace-collapsed) last name and the
787	     * postcode, so every owner with the same last name and postcode resolves to the same identifier
788	     * automatically. It is the first 12 upper-case hex characters of the SHA-256 digest of
789	     * {@code <normalizedLastName>|<postcode>} (an absent postcode contributes the empty string).
790	     *
791	     * @param lastName the owner's last name
792	     * @param postcode the owner's postcode, may be {@code null}
793	     * @return the deterministic household identifier
